        <mxCell id="engine" value="&lt;b&gt;estimate_shiny_cost()&lt;/b&gt;  COCOMO II.2000&lt;br&gt;Effort = 2.94 × KLOC^B × EM × 0.85&lt;br&gt;Schedule, team, caps, rush premium (≤ 2×),&lt;br&gt;coordination (+10% at 6+), ±30% range,&lt;br&gt;maintenance escalating 5%/yr, discounted TCO" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0F4C5C;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
